  "applies_to": "tekmar (Watts) 681 interface that connects a snow/ice sensor and slab and outdoor sensors to a building automation system for snow melting.",
  "summary": "The tekmar 681 does not run the snow melting plant itself: it reads a snow/ice sensor, a slab sensor and an outdoor sensor and reports them to the BAS over BACnet MS/TP, which then runs the boiler or electric heat. It exposes the temperatures, a slab target, snow, wet and melt-pending flags, warm and cold weather limits and an error code, and the BAS can write the melt setpoint, the sensitivity and an outdoor temperature.",
