    "Native BACnet MS/TP, vendor ID 585 (tekmar Control Systems), protocol revision 14, device profile B-ASC.",
    "The manual marks the Binary Inputs R/W, as listed here; they are status flags.",
    "Error codes: 1 settings memory, 2 local and BAS outdoor sensor, 3 slab sensor, 4-6 snow sensor yellow/blue/brown wire, 7 snow/ice sensor, 8 snow sensor.",
    "Temperatures are in °F."
