  "integration": {
    "summary": "Wire the 681 to the BACnet MS/TP trunk (A, B, Ref) and match the baud rate. The BAS reads Snow Detected, the slab temperature and slab target and runs the melting equipment itself; it can write the melt setpoint and sensitivity, and feed an outdoor temperature when BV 1 is set to the BAS source.",
